 will be settled on April 2, 2026. Accordingly, funds from these trades will be available for trading or withdrawal only after settlement is completed.\",\n            \"type\": 1,\n            \"created_by\": \"shruti@fyers.in\",\n            \"time_created\": 1774853465,\n            \"mobile\": 1,\n            \"web\": 1,\n            \"corporate_website\": 0,\n            \"fyers_web\": 1,\n            \"url\": \"https://fyers.in/notice-board/clearing-holiday-on-april-1-2026-due-to-annual-bank-closing/\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"id\": \"2026-04-01215a2e60-bac5-4085-9f36-8d83271e4332\",\n            \"title\": \"March 2026: What We Built\",\n            \"body\": \"From Smart Exit upgrades and enhanced screeners to indicator triggers in Automate, discover everything that went live across the platform. Explore the complete recap.\",\n            \"type\": 1,\n            \"created_by\": \"shruti@fyers.in\",\n            \"time_created\": 1775028857,\n            \"mobile\": 1,\n            \"web\": 1,\n            \"corporate_website\": 0,\n            \"fyers_web\": 1,\n            \"url\": \"https://fyers.in/community/blogs-gdppin8d/post/fyers-product-recap-march-2026-E5GhWZlB0fvParj\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"2026-04-03\": [\n        {\n            \"id\": \"2026-04-02e71bdb93-ea53-43f9-82ba-3d051cb3e819\",\n            \"title\": \"\\ud83d\\udce2 Trading Holiday Alert!\",\n            \"body\": \"Markets are closed today, April 3, 2026, across NSE, BSE & MCX on account of Good Friday. Withdrawal requests will be processed on April 6, 2026.\",\n            \"type\": 1,\n            \"created_by\": \"shruti@fyers.in\",\n            \"time_created\": 1775108804,\n            \"mobile\": 1,\n            \"web\": 1,\n            \"corporate_website\": 0,\n            \"fyers_web\": 1,\n            \"url\": \"https://fyers.in/notice-board/trading-holiday-on-april-3-2026-on-account-of-good-friday/\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"2026-04-02\": [\n        {\n            \"id\": \"2026-04-023145b3d4-63a1-403c-bbff-ea1909c69b05\",\n            \"title\": \"Research any IPO with FIA!\",\n            \"body\": \"Skip the 400-page Red Herring Prospectus (RHP). FIA reads it and breaks down business, financials, risks and valuation so you can decide with clarity.\",\n            \"type\": 1,\n            \"created_by\": \"shruti@fyers.in\",\n            \"time_created\": 1775117343,\n            \"mobile\": 1,\n            \"web\": 1,\n            \"corporate_website\": 0,\n            \"fyers_web\": 1,\n            \"url\": \"https://fyers.in/community/blogs-gdppin8d/post/ipo-analysis-on-fia-research-any-ipo-before-you-apply-aJTl2nAlRlt02b9\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"2026-04-10\": [\n        {\n            \"id\": \"2026-04-105b78a5d4-32c6-41a6-94ac-a60541ead9f8\",\n            \"title\": \"More control over your exits\",\n            \"body\": \"Smart Exit now has a trailing stop-loss, stays active across days, and lets you exclude positions. See what\\u2019s new.\\n\",\n            \"type\": 1,\n            \"created_by\": \"shruti@fyers.in\",\n            \"time_created\": 1775805856,\n            \"mobile\": 1,\n            \"web\": 1,\n            \"corporate_website\": 0,\n            \"fyers_web\": 1,\n            \"url\": \"https://fyers.in/community/blogs-gdppin8d/post/smart-exit---manage-all-your-positions-in-single-click-yLAW3MZfex7870r\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"2026-04-11\": [\n        {\n            \"id\": \"2026-04-10bb57f3b0-dcde-4e2d-ab65-ec12b39fe555\",\n            \"title\": \"\\ud83d\\udd14 Mock Trading Session Alert!\",\n            \"body\": \"We're participating in the exchange\\u2019s mock trading session today from 10 AM to 5:00 PM. During this time, you may notice price fluctuations on the charts.\",\n            \"type\": 1,\n            \"created_by\": \"shruti@fyers.in\",\n            \"time_created\": 1775831814,\n            \"mobile\": 1,\n            \"web\": 1,\n            \"corporate_website\": 0,\n            \"fyers_web\": 1,\n            \"url\": \"https://fyers.in/notice-board/mock-trading-session-on-11th-april-2026/\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"2026-04-17\": [\n        {\n            \"id\": \"2026-04-17b686980a-8967-46c4-ae93-7b99b652343e\",\n            \"title\": \"Quarterly settlement update!\",\n            \"body\": \"As per guidelines, the quarterly settlement will be initiated tomorrow, i.e., 18th April. Any unused funds in your trading account will be sent to your bank account. Set up an Autopay mandate for smoother and automatic fund transfers.\",\n            \"type\": 3,\n            \"created_by\": \"shruti@fyers.in\",\n            \"time_created\": 1776413643,\n            \"mobile\": 1,\n            \"web\": 1,\n            \"corporate_website\": 0,\n            \"fyers_web\": 1,\n            \"url\": \"https://support.fyers.in/portal/en/kb/articles/how-to-create-a-upi-mandate-for-fund-transfers-in-fyers\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"2026-04-25\": [\n        {\n            \"id\": \"2026-04-257edb64f3-d253-4fdb-a78a-bc92edc05763\",\n            \"title\": \"\\ud83d\\udd14 Mock Trading Session Alert!\",\n            \"body\": \"A mock trading session is scheduled today from 10:15 AM to 3:00 PM. Price fluctuations may be visible on charts during this time.\",\n            \"type\": 1,\n            \"created_by\": \"shruti@fyers.in\",\n            \"time_created\": 1777087580,\n            \"mobile\": 1,\n            \"web\": 1,\n            \"corporate_website\": 0,\n            \"fyers_web\": 1,\n            \"url\": \"https://fyers.in/notice-board/mock-trading-session-on-25th-april-2026/\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"2026-04-27\": [\n        {\n            \"id\": \"2026-04-27566baa1e-9f8a-4fa9-ba8e-9ab25cf63355\",\n            \"title\": \"Navigate faster on FYERS Web \",\n            \"body\": \"You can now open links in new tabs, windows, or split view with a simple right-click.\",\n            \"type\": 1,\n            \"created_by\": \"shruti@fyers.in\",\n            \"time_created\": 1777273101,\n            \"mobile\": 0,\n            \"web\": 0,\n            \"corporate_website\": 0,\n            \"fyers_web\": 1,\n            \"url\": \"\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"2026-05-01\": [\n        {\n            \"id\": \"2026-04-2930ecc0db-9432-492e-b82a-d5a08fdd3511\",\n            \"title\": \"\\ud83d\\udcc8 MCX Evening Session Begins at 5:00 PM\",\n            \"body\": \"Today is a trading holiday for NSE, BSE & MCX (Morning Session) on account of Maharashtra Day. The evening session for MCX & NCOM will begin at 5:00 PM. Withdrawal requests will be processed on May 4, 2026.\",\n            \"type\": 1,\n            \"created_by\": \"shruti@fyers.in\",\n            \"time_created\": 1777442659,\n            \"mobile\": 1,\n            \"web\": 1,\n            \"corporate_website\": 0,\n            \"fyers_web\": 1,\n            \"url\": \"https://fyers.in/notice-board/trading-holiday-on-may-1-2026-on-account-of-maharashtra-day/\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"id\": \"2026-05-014cde5a2b-47c1-42b6-95b8-8aa245e9be16\",\n            \"title\": \"Product Recap - April \",\n            \"body\": \"Automate got more capable, options tools got deeper, and we shipped several platform improvements. Check out everything we launched in April.\",\n            \"type\": 1,\n            \"created_by\": \"shruti@fyers.in\",\n            \"time_created\": 1777614154,\n            \"mobile\": 1,\n            \"web\": 1,\n            \"corporate_website\": 0,\n            \"fyers_web\": 1,\n            \"url\": \"https://fyers.in/community/blogs-gdppin8d/post/fyers-product-recap-april-2026-kruvCbn1yujj571\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"2026-04-30\": [\n        {\n            \"id\": \"2026-04-3007a76516-1ea1-43f7-917b-571e08858901\",\n            \"title\": \"\\ud83d\\udce2 Trading Holiday Update!\",\n            \"body\": \"Tomorrow is a trading holiday for NSE, BSE & MCX (Morning Session) on account 