      \"body\": \"A mock trading session is scheduled today from 10:00 AM to 6:00 PM. Price fluctuations may be visible on charts during this time.\",\n            \"type\": 3,\n            \"created_by\": \"shruti@fyers.in\",\n            \"time_created\": 1778850995,\n            \"mobile\": 1,\n            \"web\": 1,\n            \"corporate_website\": 0,\n            \"fyers_web\": 1,\n            \"url\": \"https://fyers.in/notice-board/mock-trading-session-on-16th-may-2026/\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"id\": \"2026-05-164d16b0f6-a1b7-48f7-a878-68916d1ee517\",\n            \"title\": \"\\ud83d\\udce2 Monthly / Non-traded payout processed!\",\n            \"body\": \"As per SEBI guidelines, the monthly or non-traded payout is under process. As a result, the funds may not reflect in your account until EOD. \",\n            \"type\": 1,\n            \"created_by\": \"shruti@fyers.in\",\n            \"time_created\": 1778901978,\n            \"mobile\": 1,\n            \"web\": 1,\n            \"corporate_website\": 0,\n            \"fyers_web\": 1,\n            \"url\": \"https://fyers.in/notice-board/mandatory-monthly-non-traded-settlement-payout-on-16th-may-2026/\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"id\": \"2026-05-16aef13174-7224-43cb-875c-bbf3483c0561\",\n            \"title\": \"Missing your signals?\",\n            \"body\": \"Watch how Indicator Triggers in FYERS Automate can place orders when your indicator signal is triggered.\",\n            \"type\": 1,\n            \"created_by\": \"shruti@fyers.in\",\n            \"time_created\": 1778906628,\n            \"mobile\": 1,\n            \"web\": 1,\n            \"corporate_website\": 0,\n            \"fyers_web\": 1,\n            \"url\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZA8i3dIXhuI\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"2026-05-17\": [\n        {\n            \"id\": \"2026-05-16486cc9f6-c670-495c-b4a4-bbcda7521440\",\n            \"title\": \"2Charts. 1 Screen.\",\n            \"body\": \"Watch how